#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:5 40c051b91b5b433e936846e44dddcb4f
msgid "Automatic Landing"
msgstr "自动降落"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:7 5122b0faee5c476e95f18829325bb0dc
msgid ""
"This article explains how to autonomously land Plane as part of a mission"
" plan or the new AUTOLAND mode (available in ver 4.7(dev/latest) and "
"later, see :ref:`mode_autoland`), and includes information about how a "
"landing can be safely aborted. Switching to AUTO mode and executing an "
"autolanding can also be done as an RTL action using the ``DO_LAND_START``"
" mission command."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何在任务计划中自主降落 Plane，或使用新的 AUTOLAND 模式（4.7(dev/latest) 及更高版本可用，参见 "
":ref:`mode_autoland`），并包含如何安全中止降落的信息。切换至 AUTO 模式并执行自动降落，也可以通过 "
"``DO_LAND_START`` 任务命令作为 RTL 动作来完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:10 661cbdf2f4714c23ab7a0d2579d7f6f7
msgid "Configuring for Automatic Landing"
msgstr "配置自动降落"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:12 6dd4af6bb5be45efb4dfd3508f769d45
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To autoland the plane you need to add a :ref:`NAV_LAND "
"<mav_cmd_nav_land>` command to the end of your mission indicating the "
"latitude, longitude and altitude of your desired touchdown point and if "
"aborting the autoland is allowed. When the preceding waypoint is reached,"
" it will descend and navigate to the touchdown point."
msgstr ""
"要自动降落飞机，您需要在任务末尾添加一个 :ref:`NAV_LAND <mav_cmd_nav_land>` "
"命令，指定期望接地点的纬度、经度和高度，以及是否允许中止自动降落。到达前一个航点后，飞机将下降并导航至接地点。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:14 1a71aa2ad34f4d1bbcb42c118cf0b599
msgid ""
"In most cases, the altitude should be set to 0. During the final flare "
"portion of the landing, the autopilot will shut down the throttle and "
"hold the current heading, controlled by the parameters described below."
msgstr "在大多数情况下，高度应设置为0。在降落最终拉平阶段，飞控将关闭油门并保持当前航向，由以下描述的参数控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:16 df17ef436c5645138db4d67d53318f43
msgid ""
"the altitude is relative to home, which is set at arming. If you arm "
"while holding for a hand launch, this means home altitude will be several"
" meters above the ground!"
msgstr "高度是相对于 Home 点的，Home 点在解锁时设置。如果您在手持待投中解锁，这意味着 Home 高度将比地面高出数米！"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:18 f4584f18d8e84c7c9a042c7c3914afdb
msgid ""
"often the internal temperature of the vehicle, and hence that of the "
"baro, will change significantly during the flight. While most baros are "
"temperature compensated, this is not usually extremely accurate, leading "
"to the home alt potentially drifting a few meters. This can cause "
"inaccurate flare height to occur. This often occurs when quickly arming "
"the vehicle after riding to the flying site in a car on cold or hot days,"
" or when heat from a component like a video transmitter raises the cabin "
"temperature during a flight after arming."
msgstr ""
"通常，飞行器内部温度，进而气压计温度，在飞行过程中会发生显著变化。虽然大多数气压计都经过温度补偿，但通常精度不高，导致 Home "
"高度可能漂移数米。这在寒冷或炎热天气乘车前往飞行场地后迅速解锁飞行器时，或在飞行中视频发射器等组件散热导致机舱温度升高时，尤为常见。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:20 1f3c192a14fe4ff9aa3cc975c94e9147
msgid ""
"For many vehicles, most of the parameters associated with autolanding can"
" be left at their defaults. The basic parameters are covered below in the"
" Basic Autolanding Section for vehicles not using an airspeed sensor "
"and/or rangefinder. For more advanced configuration, see the sections "
"listed below:"
msgstr "对于许多飞行器，与自动降落相关的大部分参数可以保持默认值。以下基本参数部分涵盖了不使用空速传感器和/或测距仪的飞行器的基本参数。有关更高级的配置，请参阅以下列出的章节："

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:32 21ff6fd5e593407eb8e7138626460070
msgid "Basic Autolanding"
msgstr "基本自动降落"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:34 cc94041cec3b4632b3794c93a9bdc16a
msgid "The phases of an autolanding are:"
msgstr "自动降落的阶段包括："

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:36 511c431451204a61a8163a749bc1564a
msgid "Passing final approach waypoint"
msgstr "通过最终进近航点"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:37 93e7fd0eccf24518b94352083ea85b0e
msgid "Navigating to the flare point on a \"glide-slope\" (ie controlled descent)"
msgstr "沿「滑翔坡道」（即受控下降）导航至拉平点"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:38 65f5df7869374ea58bb2d95fd9d632c1
msgid "Flare and touchdown"
msgstr "拉平与接地"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:44 51cd762ba9054a14a8eddb2ec59c4fd4
msgid "Setting Up the Approach Waypoint"
msgstr "设置进近航点"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:46 ce409e01eaa54de993bc25e242114e0b
msgid ""
"The autolanding begins after reaching the last navigation waypoint before"
" the NAV_LAND waypoint (where you want to touchdown and land). This "
"waypoint must be far enough from the touchdown point and at an altitude "
"that a reasonable glide slope can be obtained. Without an airspeed "
"sensor, the speed will be that of normal waypoint navigation, which "
"without an airspeed sensor is primarily controlled by "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>`. It is important to have a glide "
"slope that is obtainable with the :ref:`TECS_SINK_MAX<TECS_SINK_MAX>` "
"rate of the vehicle and preferably, well below that rate. You can lower "
"the approach airspeed in order to reduce the time in the flare, and "
"possible overshoot of landing point, by adjusting the "
":ref:`TECS_LAND_THR<TECS_LAND_THR>` to a lower value than "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>`. Be careful, not to lower it so much "
"as to cause a stall on approach."
msgstr ""
"自动降落在到达 NAV_LAND "
"航点（您希望接地降落的地点）之前的最后一个导航航点后开始。该航点必须距接地点足够远，且高度适当，以获得合理的滑翔坡道。不使用空速传感器时，速度将与正常航点导航速度相同，在没有空速传感器的情况下，主要由"
" :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` 控制。重要的是，滑翔坡道的下沉率应在飞行器 "
":ref:`TECS_SINK_MAX<TECS_SINK_MAX>` 速率范围内，最好远低于该速率。您可以通过将 "
":ref:`TECS_LAND_THR<TECS_LAND_THR>` 调低至低于 "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` "
"的值来降低进近空速，以减少拉平时间及可能的降落点超出。但请注意，不要调得过低以致进近时失速。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:48 343286190101437c93cc52b90e666f7c
msgid ""
"In addition, the last navigation waypoint before NAV_LAND must be far "
"enough away that any turns made by the mission to that waypoint will have"
" already be completed and the vehicle back on track in a line to the "
"landing point. Usually, two waypoints are used. The first to allow any "
"mission item (including aborted go-arounds for an autoland reattempt) to "
"get aligned to another waypoint setup closer to the touchdown point but "
"still providing a nice glide slope. We will designate the last waypoint "
"before the NAV_LAND as the \"final approach\" waypoint and the one before"
" it the \"pre-approach\" waypoint, as shown above. The next figure shows "
"these waypoints **incorrectly** placed, without sufficient spacing:"
msgstr ""
"此外，NAV_LAND "
"之前的最后一个导航航点必须足够远，以确保任务转向该航点时已完成，飞行器已恢复至朝向降落点的直线轨迹。通常使用两个航点。第一个用于使任何任务项（包括自动降落重试的复飞）对准另一个更靠近接地点但仍提供良好滑翔坡道的航点。我们将"
" NAV_LAND 之前的最后一个航点称为「最终进近」航点，其前一个称为「预进近」航点，如上图所示。下图展示了这些航点 **错误地** "
"放置、间距不足的情况："

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:53 f997b11f2dea4f88be39c25e3c836aaf
msgid ""
"The above shows a planned approach with the pre-approach waypoint 440m "
"away from touchdown at 50m altitude, the final approach waypoint at 220m "
"away and 25m altitude, giving a supposedly gentle glide slope of 6 "
"degrees (which is a 1.7m/s descent at 15m/s airspeed). However, the "
"actual result is 9 deg glide path since the switch to AUTO mode and the "
"landing sequence was begun at the point shown at beginning of the yellow "
"path, and the resulting overshoots at the two waypoints result in a "
"steeper glide slope (9 degrees) between the final approach waypoint and "
"the touchdown point. Spacing the waypoints a little further away would "
"have allowed the approach to have settled by the final approach waypoint,"
" and with the desired final glide slope. The faster the vehicle is "
"flying, the wider the turn radii are, and the wider the waypoints should "
"be spaced."
msgstr ""
"上图显示了一个规划进近：预进近航点距接地点440米、高度50米，最终进近航点距接地点220米、高度25米，理论上形成6度的平缓滑翔坡道（15m/s空速下下降率为1.7m/s）。然而，实际结果是9度滑翔路径，因为切换到"
" AUTO "
"模式并从黄色路径起始点开始降落序列，两个航点处的超调导致最终进近航点与接地点之间的滑翔坡道更陡（9度）。将航点间距稍微拉大，就能使进近在最终进近航点前稳定下来，并获得理想的最终滑翔坡道。飞行器飞行越快，转弯半径越大，航点间距也应越大。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:55 888e522172fb44c3855a487bfa9cd5d9
msgid ""
"You can use QGroundControl to automatically setup your approach and "
"landing waypoints, but it will use a slightly different approach. Using "
"the \"LAND\" button on the Plan screen, QGroundControl will add a "
"\"LOITER_TO_ALT\" waypoint (NAV_LOITER_TO_ALT) at a distance determined "
"by its wizard's glide slope parameter to bring the vehicle down (or up) "
"to approach altitude, add a DO_LAND_START (See :ref:`aborting-"
"autolanding`) marker, and a NAV_LAND."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用 QGroundControl "
"自动设置进近和降落航点，但它会使用略有不同的方法。使用计划界面上的「LAND」按钮，QGroundControl "
"将添加一个「LOITER_TO_ALT」航点（NAV_LOITER_TO_ALT），距离由其向导的滑翔坡道参数决定，将飞行器降低（或升高）至进近高度，添加"
" DO_LAND_START（参见 :ref:`aborting-autolanding`）标记，以及 NAV_LAND。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:57 1be1df5239944ce9b9b54d603cce895a
msgid ""
"Very low drag vehicles will normally require a much shallower approach "
"angle (glide slope) since they cannot lose altitude quickly while "
"maintaining :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` (for vehicles with "
"airspeed sensors) during the glide slope. Often a much steeper approach "
"is required to clear obstacles. In those cases, there is an option "
"(:ref:`TECS_OPTIONS<TECS_OPTIONS>` bit 1) that when set allows the speed "
"in descents to exceed :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` up to "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` in order to get up the the "
":ref:`TECS_SINK_MAX<TECS_SINK_MAX>` descent rate,if required. This would "
"apply not only to autolandings but any TECS speed controlled flight "
"stage."
msgstr ""
"阻力极低的飞行器通常需要更浅的进近角（滑翔坡道），因为在滑翔坡道中保持 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` "
"（对于有空速传感器的飞行器）的同时无法快速失去高度。为避开障碍物，往往需要更陡峭的进近。在这些情况下，有一个选项（:ref:`TECS_OPTIONS<TECS_OPTIONS>`"
" 第1位），设置后允许下降时速度超过 :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`，最高至 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>`，以便在需要时达到 "
":ref:`TECS_SINK_MAX<TECS_SINK_MAX>` 下沉率。这不仅适用于自动降落，也适用于任何 TECS 速度控制的飞行阶段。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:61 631334d2e0144d03b1b7b5caabac7a73
