msgid ":ref:`TECS_LAND_THR<TECS_LAND_THR>`"
msgstr ":ref:`TECS_LAND_THR<TECS_LAND_THR>`"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:71 2d37325831cf40d59b28c5ebef303319
msgid ""
"The TECS parameters are related to the glide slope and final flare sink "
"control. As such, the :ref:`TECS speed/height controller<tecs-total-"
"energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide>` must be tuned "
"correctly, and the vehicle must have good pitch tuning for TECS to "
"operate properly (see :ref:`common-tuning`)"
msgstr ""
"TECS 参数与滑翔坡道和最终拉平下沉控制相关。因此，:ref:`TECS 速度/高度控制器<tecs-total-energy-control-"
"system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide>` 必须经过正确调参，且飞行器必须具备良好的俯仰调参，TECS "
"才能正常工作（参见 :ref:`common-tuning`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:73 f582a3dcc48e4046831398f9570024ad
msgid ""
"The meaning and recommended value of each of these parameters is "
"described below."
msgstr "以下将说明每个参数的含义和推荐值。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:79 cf23a226eb1a482c840a228f3f4b79e4
msgid "Setting the Flare Point"
msgstr "设置拉平点"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:81 f9c7c5aa506f4f96b3c9966b6336438a
msgid ""
"The \"flare\" is the final stage of the landing when the autopilot cuts "
"the throttle and raises the pitch, increasing drag and slowing the "
"aircraft to sink onto the ground. The appropriate time to flare depends "
"on the type of aircraft, and is controlled by the :ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT "
"<LAND_FLARE_ALT>` and :ref:`LAND_FLARE_SEC <LAND_FLARE_SEC>` parameters."
msgstr ""
"「拉平」是降落的最后阶段，此时飞控切断油门并抬高俯仰，增大阻力并减速，使飞机沉降至地面。拉平的适当时机取决于飞机类型，由 "
":ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT <LAND_FLARE_ALT>` 和 :ref:`LAND_FLARE_SEC "
"<LAND_FLARE_SEC>` 参数控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:83 e73264da65ee450d982f70d0f973b5ba
msgid ""
"The first control of the flare is the :ref:`LAND_FLARE_SEC "
"<LAND_FLARE_SEC>` parameter. This is the time in seconds before the "
"aircraft would hit the ground if it continued with its current descent "
"rate."
msgstr ""
"拉平的第一个控制因素是 :ref:`LAND_FLARE_SEC <LAND_FLARE_SEC>` "
"参数。这是飞机以当前下沉率继续飞行将撞地所需的时间（秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:86 9715a769fb874324ae3f25014ad40abc
msgid ""
"So if the plane is descending at 2 meters/second and you set the "
":ref:`LAND_FLARE_SEC <LAND_FLARE_SEC>` to 3 then the aircraft would flare"
" at an altitude of 6 meters above the ground. By using a time to impact "
"to control the flare the aircraft is able to flare at a higher altitude "
"if it is descending quickly, and at a lower altitude if it is descending "
"slowly. That helps ensure the flare is able to produce a smooth "
"touchdown."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果飞机以2米/秒下降，且您将 :ref:`LAND_FLARE_SEC <LAND_FLARE_SEC>` "
"设置为3，则飞机将在距地面6米高度处拉平。通过使用撞击时间来控制拉平，飞机在快速下降时能够在较高高度拉平，在缓慢下降时则在较低高度拉平。这有助于确保拉平能实现平稳接地。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:89 25588d26675747c987e9162967e05bc0
msgid ""
"The second control is :ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT <LAND_FLARE_ALT>`. That is an "
"altitude above the ground in meters at which the aircraft will flare, "
"regardless of its descent rate. It is important that this value be close "
"to the altitude that will usually result from the :ref:`LAND_FLARE_SEC "
"<LAND_FLARE_SEC>`, since it is used in later calculations. Changing the "
"descent rate required from the last waypoint before the landing will "
"impact the height at which :ref:`LAND_FLARE_SEC <LAND_FLARE_SEC>` would "
"become active and should be adjusted accordingly."
msgstr ""
"第二个控制因素是 :ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT "
"<LAND_FLARE_ALT>`。这是飞机拉平时距地面的高度（米），无论其下沉率如何。重要的是，该值应接近 "
":ref:`LAND_FLARE_SEC <LAND_FLARE_SEC>` "
"通常产生的高度，因为它将用于后续计算。更改最后一个降落前航点所需下沉率会影响 :ref:`LAND_FLARE_SEC "
"<LAND_FLARE_SEC>` 生效的高度，应相应调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:91 9e7f3ff7320e484ca43c11ab8efc0fef
msgid ""
"Whichever is reached first will force the beginning of the flare.The "
"appropriate values for these two parameters depends on how the autopilot "
"is estimating its altitude above the ground."
msgstr "先达到哪个条件，拉平即开始。这两个参数的适当值取决于飞控估算距地高度的方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:93 91daac18d25643d087e614f132db262c
msgid ""
"If you are relying solely on a barometer for landing altitude then you "
"will probably need higher values, to account for barometric errors (see "
":ref:`improving-autolanding` below). The defaults are usually appropriate"
" as a starting point for 1-1.5 meter wingspan vehicles."
msgstr ""
"如果仅依靠气压计来确定降落高度，则可能需要较高的值，以应对气压误差（参见下文 :ref:`improving-"
"autolanding`）。默认值通常适合1-1.5米翼展飞行器作为起始点。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:95 7ec834b8717f4e9cbe4a300753f53a28
msgid ""
"With a very well tuned vehicle (both Attitude and TECS) and using a "
"rangefinder, lower altitudes can be attempted to start the flare."
msgstr "对于调参良好（姿态和 TECS 均良好）且使用测距仪的飞行器，可以尝试在较低高度开始拉平。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:98 0cc94d465d5b40be969faf2d419e3b3c
msgid "Controlling the glide slope"
msgstr "控制滑翔坡道"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:100 715300d897f840c1ba50b2587d72bb16
msgid ""
"Another important factor in setting up the flare point is the glide "
"slope. The glide slope is the ratio of the distance from the last "
"waypoint to the landing point, and the height difference between the last"
" waypoint and the landing point. For example, if the landing point is 300"
" meters from the last waypoint, and the last waypoint is 30 meters above "
"the ground then the glide slope is 10%."
msgstr "设置拉平点的另一个重要因素是滑翔坡道。滑翔坡道是最后一个航点到降落点距离与最后一个航点和降落点高度差之比。例如，如果降落点距最后一个航点300米，且最后一个航点距地面30米，则滑翔坡道为10%。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:102 dc0fa97a725941c9a157d2c13fc92f4e
msgid ""
"If the glide slope is too steep then the aircraft will not be able to "
"flare in time to avoid crashing, plus the autopilot may not be able to "
"keep the plane on the approach slope accurately. It is recommended that "
"you start with a glide slope of at most 10%. What glide slope your plane "
"can handle will depend on how good your pitch controller tuning is, how "
"good your TECS tuning is, and the landing speed you ask for."
msgstr ""
"如果滑翔坡道过陡，飞机将无法及时拉平以避免坠毁，且飞控可能无法准确保持飞机在进近坡道上。建议从最多10%的滑翔坡道开始。您的飞机能够处理的滑翔坡道取决于俯仰控制器调参质量、TECS"
" 调参质量以及所要求的降落速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:104 6cc582caab784913bb4ed2162c4e7e50
msgid ""
"If you find your aircraft is not following the desired glide slope "
"accurately then you should first check your pitch tuning in your logs, "
"and ensure that the demanded and achieved pitch match within a couple of "
"degrees during landing. If they don't then look at the documentation on "
"pitch tuning (or possibly re-run AUTOTUNE). If the demanded and achieved "
"pitch do match then you should check your TECS logs to ensure that the "
"demanded and achieved airspeed are matching during landing. Have a look "
"at the :ref:`TECS tuning page <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-"
"speed-height-tuning-guide>` for more information."
msgstr ""
"如果您发现飞机未能准确跟随预期滑翔坡道，应首先在日志中检查俯仰调参，确保降落时要求和实际俯仰在数度以内吻合。如果不吻合，请查阅俯仰调参文档（或考虑重新运行"
" AUTOTUNE）。如果要求和实际俯仰吻合，则应检查 TECS 日志，确保降落时要求和实际空速吻合。更多信息请参阅 :ref:`TECS "
"调参页面 <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:113 59959bf3852f4a8389a1a68d5e25194e
msgid ""
"You should also be aware that many model aircraft can glide for long "
"distances, and it may be that your requested glide slope and airspeed "
"combination just isn't achievable."
msgstr "您还应注意，许多模型飞机可以长距离滑翔，您所要求的滑翔坡道和空速组合可能根本无法实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:120 d0ad53021d474328a24ce121899dfe20
msgid "Controlling the flare"
msgstr "控制拉平"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:122 3dceccc20da44386abde20b35071eb24
msgid ""
"The final stage of the landing is called the \"flare\". During the flare "
"the aircraft tries to retain a course along the line between the last "
"waypoint and the landing waypoint, and it controls its height solely "
"using a target descent rate. Once the flare is started the throttle is "
"\"disabled\" - set to some value between :ref:`THR_MIN <THR_MIN>` and "
"zero."
msgstr ""
"降落的最后阶段称为「拉平」。在拉平过程中，飞机试图沿最后一个航点与降落航点之间的连线保持航向，并仅通过目标下沉率控制高度。一旦拉平开始，油门将被「禁用」——设置为"
" :ref:`THR_MIN <THR_MIN>` 与零之间的某个值。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:129 a3c314dc6ffa43b1af057d0c39f090a9
msgid ""
"The main job of the autopilot in the flare is to try to achieve the "
"descent rate specified in the :ref:`TECS_LAND_SINK <TECS_LAND_SINK>` "
"parameter. That defaults to 0.25 meters/second, which is a reasonable "
"touchdown vertical speed for most models. To achieve that speed the TECS "
"controller uses pitch control only as the motor has been forced to zero."
msgstr ""
"飞控在拉平中的主要任务是尽量达到 :ref:`TECS_LAND_SINK <TECS_LAND_SINK>` "
"参数规定的下沉率。默认值为0.25米/秒，对大多数模型而言是合理的接地垂直速度。为实现该速度，TECS "
"控制器在电机被强制归零的情况下仅使用俯仰控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:133 ef582ea2f5464d7fa91297813d439380
msgid ""
"The primary parameters which affect the ability of the aircraft to "
"achieve the desired descent rate are :ref:`LAND_PITCH_DEG "
"<LAND_PITCH_DEG>`, :ref:`TECS_LAND_DAMP <TECS_LAND_DAMP>` and the main "
"pitch tuning parameters."
msgstr ""
"影响飞机实现期望下沉率能力的主要参数为 :ref:`LAND_PITCH_DEG "
"<LAND_PITCH_DEG>`、:ref:`TECS_LAND_DAMP <TECS_LAND_DAMP>` 以及主要俯仰调参参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:139 589ef26f0550440eba68fa4214db42ff
msgid ""
"If the vehicle does not have good pitch tuning, the vehicle's CG is "
"significantly \"nose heavy\", or the elevator is being increased by "
"propeller slip-stream, then the ability of the vehicle to actually attain"
" the desired sink rates and attitudes can be severely impacted. Symptoms "
"are landing short, and/or with the nose/nose wheel touching down first."
msgstr "如果飞行器俯仰调参不良、飞行器重心明显「头重」，或升降舵受螺旋桨滑流增强，则飞行器实际达到期望下沉率和姿态的能力将受到严重影响。症状为落点偏短，和/或机头/前轮先触地。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:141 8f069e42765a4eeb81479f724ad19971
msgid ""
"The landing controller sets a point before the touchdown as the expected "
"flare start point. This \"flare_aim\" point is calculated from the "
":ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>` and "
":ref:`TECS_LAND_SINK<TECS_LAND_SINK>` for the expected duration of the "
"flare before the actual touchdown. If consistently landing long or short,"
" this point can be adjusted using the "
":ref:`LAND_FLARE_AIM<LAND_FLARE_AIM>` parameter. If landing too short, "
"decrease the percentage from its default of 50%, conversely, increasing "
"it if landing too long."
msgstr ""
"降落控制器在接地前设定一个预期拉平开始点。该「flare_aim」点由 :ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>`"
" 和 :ref:`TECS_LAND_SINK<TECS_LAND_SINK>` "
"计算，对应实际接地前拉平预期持续时间。如果落点持续偏长或偏短，可使用 :ref:`LAND_FLARE_AIM<LAND_FLARE_AIM>` "
"参数进行调整。若落点偏短，将百分比从默认值50%降低；若落点偏长，则增大该值。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:143 82d7b1570d014a0a8d94b8645fe71098
msgid ""
"The transition from the glide-slope sink rate to the flare sink rate is "
"controlled by the :ref:`TECS_FLARE_HGT<TECS_FLARE_HGT>` parameter and "
"should normally be set below :ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>`. The "
"start of the flare will occur at :ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>` "
"and the sink rate will be gradually adjusted to "
":ref:`TECS_LAND_SINK<TECS_LAND_SINK>` at the "
":ref:`TECS_FLARE_HGT<TECS_FLARE_HGT>` to avoid a rapid pitch change at "
"the beginning of the flare, which would tend to create a \"ballooning\" "
"effect at the start of the flare. See note at the end of this section for"
" a possible exception to having :ref:`TECS_FLARE_HGT<TECS_FLARE_HGT>` set"
" lower than :ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>`."
msgstr ""
"从滑翔坡道下沉率到拉平下沉率的过渡由 :ref:`TECS_FLARE_HGT<TECS_FLARE_HGT>` 参数控制，通常应设置低于 "
":ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>`。拉平将在 "
":ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>` 处开始，下沉率将逐渐调整至在 "
":ref:`TECS_FLARE_HGT<TECS_FLARE_HGT>` 高度达到 "
":ref:`TECS_LAND_SINK<TECS_LAND_SINK>`，以避免拉平开始时俯仰剧变，从而产生「气球效应」。关于 "
":ref:`TECS_FLARE_HGT<TECS_FLARE_HGT>` 设置高于 "
":ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>` 的可能例外，请参阅本节末尾的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:145 7aa9517c8b08457db34131ff161e5c1e
msgid ""
"The :ref:`LAND_PITCH_DEG <LAND_PITCH_DEG>` parameter sets the minimum "
"pitch target at the very end of the flare (in centi-degrees). This "
"parameter is very airframe specific and is designed to prevent the nose "
"of the aircraft being too far down on touchdown causing issues with "
"damaging the landing gear or breaking a propeller.  For most aircraft "
"this should be a small positive number (such as 300, meaning 3 degrees), "
"but for some belly landing aircraft a small negative number can be good, "
"to allow the nose to be kept down a small amount to reduce the chance of "
"stall if the flare happens too far off the ground."
msgstr ""
":ref:`LAND_PITCH_DEG <LAND_PITCH_DEG>` "
"参数设置拉平最末段的最小俯仰目标（以厘度为单位）。该参数非常依赖于机架，旨在防止飞机机头在接地时过度低头，导致起落架损坏或螺旋桨折断。对大多数飞机，该值应为较小的正数（例如300，即3度），但对某些机腹降落飞机，较小的负数可能更好，以便在机头稍微低头的情况下减少拉平过高时的失速风险。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:155 82d2abaa24e54cf1923e601833d1fb90
msgid ""
"Note that the actual pitch of the aircraft can be quite a bit above "
":ref:`LAND_PITCH_DEG <LAND_PITCH_DEG>` as the TECS controller tries to "
"control the descent rate. The maximum pitch is controlled by the "
":ref:`TECS_PITCH_MAX <TECS_PITCH_MAX>` parameter if it is non-zero, "
"otherwise by the :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG <PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"请注意，飞机的实际俯仰可能远高于 :ref:`LAND_PITCH_DEG <LAND_PITCH_DEG>`，因为 TECS "
"控制器试图控制下沉率。最大俯仰由 :ref:`TECS_PITCH_MAX <TECS_PITCH_MAX>` 参数控制（若非零），否则由 "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG <PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` 参数控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:158 ae05f3476f1c487091be3a262e4c66b2
msgid ""
"However, if the vehicle cannot maintain the demanded pitch attitude in "
"the later stages of the flare due to CG, tuning, etc. "
":ref:`LAND_PITCH_DEG <LAND_PITCH_DEG>` may never be reached resulting in "
"nose/nose wheel first touchdowns. In that case, set the "
":ref:`TECS_FLARE_HGT<TECS_FLARE_HGT>` ABOVE the "
":ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>` parameter, effectively allowing the"
" :ref:`LAND_PITCH_DEG <LAND_PITCH_DEG>` limit to take effect immediately,"
" increasing the rate at which its demanded (i.e. at the beginning of the "
"flare as opposed to the end)"
msgstr ""
"但是，如果飞行器因重心、调参等原因在拉平后期无法维持要求的俯仰姿态，:ref:`LAND_PITCH_DEG <LAND_PITCH_DEG>` "
"可能永远无法达到，导致机头/前轮先触地。在这种情况下，将 :ref:`TECS_FLARE_HGT<TECS_FLARE_HGT>` 设置为 "
"**高于** :ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>` 参数，可使 :ref:`LAND_PITCH_DEG "
"<LAND_PITCH_DEG>` 限制立即生效，从而提高其要求速率（即在拉平开始时而非结束时）。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:160 c0e4d8ff0df34b96b8e18f3e3b90e84c
msgid ""
"The :ref:`TECS_LAND_DAMP<TECS_LAND_DAMP>` parameter is a damping constant"
" for the pitch control during flare. A larger number will cause the pitch"
" demand to change more slowly. This parameter can be used to reduce "
"issues with sudden pitch changes when the flare happens."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TECS_LAND_DAMP<TECS_LAND_DAMP>` "
"参数是拉平期间俯仰控制的阻尼常数。数值越大，俯仰需求变化越慢。该参数可用于减少拉平时突然俯仰变化带来的问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:165 4161e993742a4fd2adf3e984fd9b11a0
msgid ""
"you can use :ref:`STICK_MIXING<STICK_MIXING>` to allow manual adjustments"
" during the flare, if needed, while tuning the above parameters."
msgstr "如果需要，在调整上述参数时，您可以使用 :ref:`STICK_MIXING<STICK_MIXING>` 允许在拉平期间进行手动调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:167 b724297d328a4720bfabe35848a1d908
msgid ""
"For most well tuned vehicles the default values for all the landing "
"parameters should result in safe landings. Iteratively adjusting the "
"altitude limits and the aim point parameter will usually lead to almost "
"perfect, repeatable landings. Analyzing the logs for TECS.dh vs "
"TECS.dhdem and ATT.Pitch vs ATT.DesPitch will show how well the vehicle "
"is attaining the desired attitude and sink rates in the flare."
msgstr ""
"对于大多数调参良好的飞行器，所有降落参数的默认值都应能实现安全降落。逐步调整高度限制和瞄准点参数，通常可以实现近乎完美、可重复的降落。分析日志中的"
" TECS.dh 与 TECS.dhdem 以及 ATT.Pitch 与 "
"ATT.DesPitch，将显示飞行器在拉平期间实现期望姿态和下沉率的效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:170 e8997e82fc4f4c91a70b9f94c52723cf
msgid "After the Flare"
msgstr "拉平后"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:172 324e5312b613408ab643b037e8590f07
msgid ""
"After the plane flares it continues to navigate, but with zero throttle. "
"The navigation direction is a line extrapolated forward through the "
"landing point from the last waypoint. Note that the navigation roll will "
"be limited to :ref:`LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT <LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT>` (which defaults "
"to 5 degrees) to prevent wing strike, so if there is a significant cross-"
"wind then it is likely that the aircraft will not be able to maintain the"
" exact path."
msgstr ""
"飞机拉平后，以零油门继续导航。导航方向为从最后一个航点经降落点向前延伸的直线。请注意，导航横滚将限制在 "
":ref:`LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT <LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT>` "
"（默认为5度）以防翼尖触地，因此如果存在明显侧风，飞机可能无法保持精确路径。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:180 0d041e5b145043a59e356b55b5e81492
msgid ""
"If your aircraft is consistently landing long (which can happen for a "
"variety of reasons) then you can adjust :ref:`TECS_LAND_SRC "
"<TECS_LAND_SRC>` to either force a stall (negative) or bring it down "
"(positive). This value will adjust your :ref:`TECS_LAND_SRC "
"<TECS_LAND_SRC>` proportional to the distance from the LAND point. This "
"helps ensure you land in a reasonable distance from the LAND point."
msgstr ""
"如果飞机持续落点偏长（可能由多种原因导致），可以调整 :ref:`TECS_LAND_SRC <TECS_LAND_SRC>` "
"以强制失速（负值）或加速下沉（正值）。该值将按与 LAND 点距离的比例调整 :ref:`TECS_LAND_SRC "
"<TECS_LAND_SRC>`，有助于确保在距 LAND 点合理距离内降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:190 b4f4fd142ef849f0b858b1342992890d
msgid ""
"Possible causes of landing long include ground effect giving the aircraft"
" more lift as it is close to the ground or simply the aircraft traveling "
"very fast."
msgstr "落点偏长的可能原因包括：飞机接近地面时地效提供额外升力，或飞机飞行速度过快。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:194 09f753fd11c34873939a5e33424cf24e
msgid ""
"When the plane has stopped moving for :ref:`LAND_DISARMDELAY "
"<LAND_DISARMDELAY>` seconds (default 20 seconds) it will disarm the "
"motor. Optionally, you can disable servo movement once LAND_DISARMDELAY "
"has triggered by setting :ref:`LAND_THEN_NEUTRL <LAND_THEN_NEUTRL>`."
msgstr ""
"当飞机停止移动 :ref:`LAND_DISARMDELAY <LAND_DISARMDELAY>` 秒（默认20秒）后，将上锁电机。您也可以在 "
"LAND_DISARMDELAY 触发后通过设置 :ref:`LAND_THEN_NEUTRL <LAND_THEN_NEUTRL>` "
"来禁用舵机运动。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:200 85edeb38624344b7ae410b54beee869c
msgid "Rudder Control during Flare and Rollout"
msgstr "拉平和滑行阶段的方向舵控制"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:202 be20a4bd5efc456995ae611af10b34b2
msgid ""
"If enabled, the ground steering controller will take over below "
":ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>` to maintain vehicle compass "
"heading below this altitude and during roll out. See :ref:`tuning-ground-"
"steering-for-a-plane` for details."
msgstr ""
"如果启用，地面转向控制器将在 :ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>` "
"以下接管，以在该高度以下及滑行阶段维持飞行器罗盘航向。详情参见 :ref:`tuning-ground-steering-"
"for-a-plane`。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:208 08e5843d6dd949b9bfada3a25fe4c4ae
msgid "Improving the landing"
msgstr "改善降落"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:210 85eb56ffcb7945098e3b8991674d7fe0
msgid ""
"The key to a good landing is the autopilot knowing how far off the ground"
" it is. With the default setup the only sensor available to detect "
"altitude is the barometer. Unfortunately barometers suffer from three "
"main types of error:"
msgstr "良好降落的关键在于飞控准确知道距地面的高度。默认设置下，唯一可用于检测高度的传感器是气压计。不幸的是，气压计有三种主要误差类型："

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:215 96a1f3d7165b4ebc97fcec2e7961711e
msgid "barometric drift due to changes in atmospheric pressure"
msgstr "大气压变化引起的气压漂移"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:216 ec29662dc873421db63ebb34efc409b8
msgid ""
"barometric drift due to changes in the temperature of the autopilot "
"electronics"
msgstr "飞控电子元件温度变化引起的气压漂移"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:218 122ce963e45c4bf395f5798f195a0fa2
msgid ""
"barometric error due to local pressure changes from airflow around the "
"barometer"
msgstr "气流绕气压计流动引起的局部气压变化导致的气压误差"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:221 e4733091e8994a76825833d1078599b8
msgid ""
"The ideal setup for good automatic landing is to have a :ref:`Lidar "
"<common-rangefinder-landingpage>`. A Lidar can measure the distance to "
"the ground very accurately, and doesn't suffer from drift. If you have a "
"Lidar installed you can enable its use for landing with "
":ref:`RNGFND_LANDING<RNGFND_LANDING>` bit 0 or 1 is set."
msgstr ""
"理想的自动降落设置是配备 :ref:`激光雷达 <common-rangefinder-"
"landingpage>`。激光雷达可以非常精确地测量到地面的距离，且不受漂移影响。如果安装了激光雷达，可通过将 "
":ref:`RNGFND_LANDING<RNGFND_LANDING>` 第0位或第1位设为1来启用其用于降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:227 b43fd9a581ed4d55bf3176e613ff5843
msgid ""
"If a Lidar isn't fitted then there are a few things you can do to "
"minimize barometric error problems with auto-land"
msgstr "如果没有安装激光雷达，有几种方法可以最大程度减少自动降落时的气压误差问题："

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:229 1c6f5d03af2e4e568eaa031a4a5addf8
msgid ""
"perform a barometer calibration after the electronics have warmed up. The"
" easiest way to do this is to disarm the plane with rudder-disarming, "
"arm/disarm switch, or the safety switch. When the plane is disarmed it "
"assumes it is on the ground and will zero the barometer to the current "
"pressure. It will also reset the HOME position and altitude."
msgstr ""
"在电子设备预热后进行气压计校准。最简单的方法是通过方向舵上锁、解锁/上锁开关或安全开关使飞机上锁。飞机上锁时，系统认为其在地面，将把气压计归零至当前气压，并重置"
" Home 位置和高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:233 46d90634d2284230bdce7ee710119cf8
msgid ""
"try to prevent direct airflow over the autopilot that could cause speed "
"related pressure changes"
msgstr "尽量防止气流直接流过飞控，以避免速度相关的气压变化"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:235 86eb9bd3236f437781eff8607918c738
msgid ""
