#: ../../source/docs/automatic-landing.rst:241 7c767b997b8d44fb923aef040bb67ae1
msgid ""
"With planes that belly land it can also work well to setup the landing "
"with a shallow pitch (in :ref:`LAND_PITCH_DEG<LAND_PITCH_DEG>`) and set a"
" slightly higher altitude to flare at. That will only work if your stall "
"speed is low enough that gliding for a while will work reliably."
msgstr ""
"对于机腹降落的飞机，也可以通过设置较浅的俯仰（在 :ref:`LAND_PITCH_DEG<LAND_PITCH_DEG>` "
"中）并设置稍高的拉平高度来实现较好效果。这只有在失速速度足够低、长时间滑翔能可靠进行时才有效。"

